# Application.Terminate in a unit (12) may end the whole app from code no caller can see
# Other Application members (17), other receivers (18) and Halt (19, halt-in-library's job) must not fire
# The program/.dpr is exempt: see halt-in-library-program.pas
application-terminate-in-library 12
!application-terminate-in-library 17
!application-terminate-in-library 18
!application-terminate-in-library 19
